{
  "name": "@hubaking/dsh-community-plugins",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "DSH 社区插件生态指南 + 本机离线审计工具：注册「dsh-community-plugins」skill，让每个会话都知道如何发现、评估、安装社区插件；并注册 dsh_plugin_audit 工具，把已装插件的 peer 区间、官方包引用、slot 契约与服务注入逐条比对到本机 dsh 构建。只提供方法与事实，不推荐任何第三方插件或市场。轻量：纯 JavaScript、单一依赖、无构建步骤。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/HubaKing/dsh-community-plugins.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/HubaKing/dsh-community-plugins",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/HubaKing/dsh-community-plugins/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "docs",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/semver.test.mjs && node test/audit.test.mjs && node test/plugin.test.mjs && node test/integration.test.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "skill",
    "plugin",
    "audit",
    "compatibility",
    "semver"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "dependencies": {
    "yaml": "^2.4.2"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
